WI-tozar shipped CONTAINED ONLY: `h(w := src())`, `acc.push(k = t)`, a
receiver, a return or a container literal stayed a USE of the name. The
reason was the walk: on a line that defined an heir it followed the heir and
did not ask where the line's call took the value, so the definition gave it
a seed it could exhaust, and `acc.push(k = t); console.log(k.length);
fetch(url + acc[0])` read confirmed_with_caveats. WI-jusoj asks that
question on the source's line and WI-tinav (PR #1789) on every use line, so
the binding is now what it is at run time, a definition.

`_Scope` drops to (conditional, in_closure) with `binds` derived;
escaping(), tested(), _TRANSPARENT_TYPES, _RETURNED and Python's if_clause
branch are removed, each a no-op once an escape keeps the binding.

